      "role": "user",
      "content": "The initial costs are one thing, but I'm more concerned about the \"complexity\" you mentioned. Can you be more specific? Like, if we actually pull the trigger on this and move away from your central orchestration, what's the realistic worst-case scenario for our life-saving drug delivery windows? Give me some hard numbers or specific risk zones.",
